      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RUBY RULES (3) has been wonderfully consistent of late and added to a string of wins and placings when she worked to the front from a wide barrier before going on to score last start, taking her strike rate at this circuit and distance to 50 per cent. She is very well placed here and a good draw will see her hard to contain. RACE FOR RICHES (5) has 5.6m to make up on RUBY RULES through the second at his latest appearance and he draws wider than that rival so it will be tough to turn the tables but he did a good job to come from the back row and score at this circuit and distance prior. REDS ABLAZE (11) placed behind the top two selections when resuming. Tougher draw but may be improved second-up. THE LADY DIOR (1) had a second line barrier last time but gets the ace here and led to score prior so could be competitive.",
